      "html": "<div class=\"ds-install\"><code>bun add @danielivanov/mention</code><button class=\"ds-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy bun add @danielivanov/mention\" title=\"Copy install command\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div>",
